body=f'<section class="hero"><img src="/hero.png" alt="OneWorldz approved artwork"><div class="copy"><p class="ey">OneWorldz 🌐 One Vision</p><h1>Helping the People Who Help People.</h1><p>Humanity first: kindness, hope, action, food, water, shelter, education, health and community. CryptoWorldz stays separate.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="/heroes/">Heroes</a><a class="btn" href="https://donateworldz.com">DonateWorldz</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Mission</h2><div class="mission">{mi}</div></section><section class="section"><h2>Real heroes</h2><div class="chips">{hi}</div></section><section class="section"><h2>Enter the ecosystem</h2><div class="grid2">{port}</div></section>'
